// The precedence table is conf.id's op_names/op_levels; this is the linear
// search over it, which is how `id` spells a map.

// Index of `s` in `ops`, or -1. Generic on purpose: the escape-character table
// in ../../pf/lit/chr/ uses it too.
find_op(string[] ops, string s) {
  int i = 0;
  int found = 0 - 1;
  while(i < len(ops)) {
    found = match_op(ops, i, s, found);
    i = i + 1;
  }
} return int found;
(["a", "b", "c"], "b"):(1)
([], "x"):(-1)
